<tr><td align=right valign=top><b>Lineage</b></td><td></td><td>This layer was originally called "Districts - Justice of the Peace" but the name was changed to the more correct "Justice Precincts" in 11/2007.<br>20120918 - District boundary changed due to 2010 census data and redistricting effort.<br>20220323 - Boundaries updated following Board of Supervisors action on 09/21/2021.<br>20240104 - Boundaries updated following Board of Supervisors action (to adjust boundaries to follow consolidated voter precinct boundaries) on 12/19/2023.</td></tr>


